WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.236
"Worst Summer Job" stories
from you guys. Here we go.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:08.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
This first one's from
@emcubedcreative. She says...

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Yeah!"
-"I know her!"

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:23.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right.
-"That's my baby!"

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.524 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"Stop it, Dad."

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:30.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from @jbest3435.
He says...

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I just saved your life.
All right. Cool.

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, you, stand up.
Saved your life.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:44.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why is everybody drowning?
Just stand up."

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.378 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"Shark!"

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:49.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"There's a shark in the pool!
Shark, stand up!"

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:49.916 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:54.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from @v-i-price.
He says...

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.765 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.534 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What?!

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.235 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Oh, he could have lied.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.437 line:92%
-What? That's not true. Come on.

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:12.472 size:78% position:39%
-That's cold-blooded.
-That's cold, man.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
I worked at Abercrombie.
-Did you really?

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:16.776 line:92%
-Yeah, I was a stockroom boy.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.012 size:88% position:44% line:92%
[ Tuba plays sad notes ]

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:19.913 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I really was, yeah.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:23.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was before
they sold out, man.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.218 line:92%
-Before they came dark...

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:26.719 line:92%
-That's the reason why, right?

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:29.422
-Yeah, that's exactly -- you got
a front-of-store face.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ]
-I appreciate that.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:34.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got a job there
because me and my buddy --

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
Me and my college roommate,
we both got it

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:39.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
because if you work there
you get a free shirt

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:40.867 line:92%
and a free pair of jeans.

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I said,
"If we both work there,

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
you get a different shirt
and a different pair of jeans,

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:45.705 line:92%
and I'll get a different --

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:49.676
Then we can just wear -- That's
our clothes for the week."

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:50.643 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Swap it out.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:51.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And so we kind of
built the store,

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we stocked it
and everything like that

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:55.014 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and folded everything.

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.182 line:92%
I hate folding everything. Ugh!

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:59.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
If could I just ask
for one thing, world peace.

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:03.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
Second thing, don't unfold
anything at a store.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:04.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It is the worst thing.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.692 line:92%
-Did you have a folder board?

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:07.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's just like --
A folder board.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.461 line:92%
But that doesn't make it easier.

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
You understand what --
They're jeans.

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:11.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why do you have to
unfold it for?

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:12.999 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Unless you're trying it.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:13.933 line:92%
"Uh, this shirt looks good."

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:17.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Yeah, it does.
Now I got to refold it."

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:22.041
This one's from @Mollie-Galvez.
She says...

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:33.253 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:36.856 size:81% position:41% line:92%
"I love you, Grandma!"

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:37.957 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-"I made these myself!"

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:41.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"I'm teaching my sweet
granddaughter how to swindle!"

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:42.896 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay.

00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:47.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from @laurieraney.
She says...

00:02:58.077 --> 00:03:01.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
That sounds fantastic.
-That sounds great.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.650 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Like a new TV show.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:07.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This one's from
@MobsterLobsterr.

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:10.089 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He says...

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:21.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"What are you doing
to the boy?!

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.836 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Get in here, Joshua!

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:29.142
Making him stand out there
and yell at birds all day!

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:31.044 size:88% position:44% line:92%
That's not right." Yeah.

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:35.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from @km-belland.
She says...

00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:47.460 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.095 line:92%
That's the winner right there.

00:03:49.095 --> 00:03:50.463 line:92%
-That's the winner. A bison.

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:55.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This last one's from
@Kataztrophie. She says...

